  "description": "Our engineers developed the Omnium Fast 2.0 with a focus on bunch races on the track. This bike builds on the success of the Arena Fast with a geometry specifically designed for optimal manoeuvrability and responsiveness in the bunch. With aerodynamic tube shapes, a newly developed handlebar, and flip chips in the fork, the Omnium Fast is the most suitable bike for every event in the omnium: the scratch race, the tempo race, the elimination race, and the points race. The Omnium Fast 2.0 now has a BSA bottom bracket, increased chainring clearance up to 72T and a revised seat post clamp.",
